* {{IPA|/kaʁˈtɔfəl/|lang=de}} {{i|standard}}
* {{IPA|/kɐˈtɔfəl/|lang=de}} {{i|common}}
* {{audio|De-at-Kartoffel.ogg|audio (Austria)|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Kartoffel.ogg|Audio|lang=de}}

